      <h3>Gradient Clipping</h3>
      <p>Per-sample gradients clipped to L2 norm ≤ C before noise addition. This bounds the sensitivity — how much one record can shift the output.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-icon">📊</div>
      <h3>RDP Accounting</h3>
      <p>Rényi DP tracks cumulative privacy cost across rounds with tight composition. Converts to (ε, δ)-DP via Mironov 2017 Proposition 3.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-icon">🛡️</div>
      <h3>Secure Aggregation</h3>
      <p>Server never sees individual client updates in plaintext. Supports Byzantine-robust aggregation (Krum, coordinate median) for adversarial clients.</p>
